    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Trust</i> is a sci-fi first-person and top-down exploration game where players control Ingram, a combat-ready humanoid robot, and Bennett, an aerial drone, to uncover the mystery of an abandoned world. Switch seamlessly between action-packed gunfights and strategic reconnaissance while managing a shared energy system that fuels both ammo and self-repair. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Dual Perspective Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Ingram in immersive first-person combat and exploration while switching to Bennett\u2019s top-down drone interface for reconnaissance and tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/970bf249b5b77f6ba3bb713682468e18.poster.avif?t=1742841206\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/970bf249b5b77f6ba3bb713682468e18.webm?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/970bf249b5b77f6ba3bb713682468e18.mp4?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drone Targeting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan, identify and select targets from Bennett's high vantage point to assist Ingram in high velocity combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/c3296735580c233dfdc81b60f093c7c0.poster.avif?t=1742841206\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/c3296735580c233dfdc81b60f093c7c0.webm?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/c3296735580c233dfdc81b60f093c7c0.mp4?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Morph Weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An advanced, shape-shifting firearm designed for Ingram, the <strong>Morph Weapon</strong> dynamically adapts to combat situations by transforming both its <strong>weapon type</strong> and <strong>ammo composition</strong> in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/4d2f1e1e7997e0fff0120472f7cbe551.poster.avif?t=1742841206\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/4d2f1e1e7997e0fff0120472f7cbe551.webm?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/4d2f1e1e7997e0fff0120472f7cbe551.mp4?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kinetic Energy System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ingram's energy reserve is a singular resource for both ammunition and health, creating a high-risk, high-mobility combat loop. This Kinetic Energy System rewards aggressive movement, making every decision a trade-off between staying alive and staying armed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some Answers Cannot Be Erased</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet <strong>Helicopolis</strong> was abandoned long ago. Now, it is a graveyard of forgotten technology. When a  signal is detected from its surface, <i>The Trust, </i>a powerful governing galactic faction, sends two embodied AI to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingram</strong>, a battle-ready humanoid combat unit, reluctantly follows orders. <strong>Bennett</strong>, an advanced aerial drone, sees the world through signals and data. Their mission is clear: find the source of the signal. But as they descend deeper into the wreckage of a lost world, they begin to question their directives, their creators, and themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Signal That Shouldn't Exist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ingram and Bennett search for answers, they uncover something far more complex than a simple transmission. Their mission is compromised. Their programming is in question.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Trust</i> is a sci-fi first-person and top-down exploration game where players control Ingram, a combat-ready humanoid robot, and Bennett, an aerial drone, to uncover the mystery of an abandoned world. Switch seamlessly between action-packed gunfights and strategic reconnaissance while managing a shared energy system that fuels both ammo and self-repair. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Dual Perspective Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Ingram in immersive first-person combat and exploration while switching to Bennett\u2019s top-down drone interface for reconnaissance and tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/970bf249b5b77f6ba3bb713682468e18.poster.avif?t=1742841206\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/970bf249b5b77f6ba3bb713682468e18.webm?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/970bf249b5b77f6ba3bb713682468e18.mp4?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drone Targeting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan, identify and select targets from Bennett's high vantage point to assist Ingram in high velocity combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/c3296735580c233dfdc81b60f093c7c0.poster.avif?t=1742841206\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/c3296735580c233dfdc81b60f093c7c0.webm?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/c3296735580c233dfdc81b60f093c7c0.mp4?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Morph Weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An advanced, shape-shifting firearm designed for Ingram, the <strong>Morph Weapon</strong> dynamically adapts to combat situations by transforming both its <strong>weapon type</strong> and <strong>ammo composition</strong> in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/4d2f1e1e7997e0fff0120472f7cbe551.poster.avif?t=1742841206\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/4d2f1e1e7997e0fff0120472f7cbe551.webm?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283380/extras/4d2f1e1e7997e0fff0120472f7cbe551.mp4?t=1742841206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kinetic Energy System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ingram's energy reserve is a singular resource for both ammunition and health, creating a high-risk, high-mobility combat loop. This Kinetic Energy System rewards aggressive movement, making every decision a trade-off between staying alive and staying armed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some Answers Cannot Be Erased</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet <strong>Helicopolis</strong> was abandoned long ago. Now, it is a graveyard of forgotten technology. When a  signal is detected from its surface, <i>The Trust, </i>a powerful governing galactic faction, sends two embodied AI to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingram</strong>, a battle-ready humanoid combat unit, reluctantly follows orders. <strong>Bennett</strong>, an advanced aerial drone, sees the world through signals and data. Their mission is clear: find the source of the signal. But as they descend deeper into the wreckage of a lost world, they begin to question their directives, their creators, and themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Signal That Shouldn't Exist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ingram and Bennett search for answers, they uncover something far more complex than a simple transmission. Their mission is compromised. Their programming is in question.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Trust is a sci-fi narrative adventure where you control Ingram, a combat robot, and Bennett, an aerial drone. Switch viewpoints, morph weapons on the fly, and manage an energy system that fuels both ammo and self-repair, replenished through movement in a high-mobility combat loop.",
